      "value": "To be clear-- both of the links you gave above are regarding Unity Cloud/Unity Collab, which has nothing to do with VRChat, nor is required to use for VRChat development.\n\nMeta files are required in Unity, as they carry the import settings of assets you have in your project. They aren't optional.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
